# Reentry Field: The Boneyard, track 3 (SPEC 19.5). The spacecraft end of
# the yard: off the shuttle's wing (a ramp over its broken wing root),
# down the east side along the scorched reentry furrow (an open edge:
# leave the road and you fall into it), through the booster forest
# standing nose-down in the sand, back across the furrow on its crust of
# fused sand (the car behind falls through), and round the fallen
# station ring, a long banked turn, to the line.
name REENTRY FIELD
order 3
floor runway
league boneyard
width 54
pit_band 6
# x    y    half   features
 260  140   58                     # start line, heading east
 500  125   58     ramp            # off the shuttle's wing
 740  130   56
 880  230   54
 900  420   52     open:right      # the furrow on the right
 800  540   50
 600  520   48     drift           # into the booster forest
 470  420   48
 340  480   48
 400  620   48
 600  735   50     crates
 790  745   52
 885  775   52
 890  870   52
 780  910   52
 520  895   52     crust           # across the furrow on its fused crust
 300  880   54     crates
 150  780   56                     # the station ring: a long banked turn
 105  600   56
 120  420   56     bay:left
 175  250   58
furrow 30 400 1030 410 900 520 815 700 805 790 640 850 470
props nose,booster seg 1 side left gap 80 off 26
props booster seg 6 side both gap 50 off 24
props booster,dish seg 8 side both gap 60 off 24
props dish,wingtip seg 16 side left gap 90 off 26
props booster seg 14 side left gap 70 off 26
